\caption(Loss on held-out synthetic molecules and predictions against analytic energies.)
\alttext(A line plot of held-out MSE alongside a scatter plot of predictions versus true energies for both models.)

The learned regressors approximate one synthetic energy function.
The invariance check applies to the trained predictions on this fixture.

> References

- [Schütt et al. (2017), SchNet](https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.08566).
- [Klicpera, Groß, and Günnemann (2020), DimeNet](https://arxiv.org/abs/2003.03123).
